TinyVDB (OpenVDB I/O, sparse level-set tools, isosurface stuffing) — vendored into lightusd
=========================================================================================

Source: https://github.com/syoyo/tinyvdbio
License: Apache License 2.0
Revision: see UPSTREAM.txt

Local integration changes are limited to repointing miniz, LZ4, and zstd
includes in tinyvdb_io.h at lightusd's existing vendored copies. `src/usdVol.cc`
maps tinyvdb's grid info and dense extraction (tinyvdb_volume.h) onto the
renderer-facing VDBGrid and its memory budget.

third_party/nanovdb/PNanoVDB.h is part of OpenVDB's NanoVDB (Copyright
Contributors to the OpenVDB Project, Apache License 2.0), used by
tinyvdb_to_nanovdb.c for NanoVDB node layouts.
